===Etymology===
From Arabic {{Arab|حديث}} (''ħadí:θ'', 'Prophetic tradition') < {{Arab|حدث}} (''ħáddaθa'', 'to tell,' 'to relate,' 'to report').

===Noun===
{{en-noun|pl='''hadith''' or '''[[hadiths]]'''}}

# {{Islam}} the [[collected]] [[saying]]s and [[action]]s of [[Muhammad]] used to [[determine]] the [[Sunna]] ([[Muslim]] way of life).

